OL,3,GNEWSACommunity holds vigil for
OL,4,ANepal-Tibet flood victims
OL,5,
OL,6,FA vigil has been held in memory of
OL,7,Fpeople killed, injured or missing
OL,8,Ffollowing flash floods along the
OL,9,FNepal-Tibet border.
OL,11,FMembers of the Nepalese community in
OL,12,FCorby, Northamptonshire, joined North
OL,13,FNorthamptonshire councillors and
OL,14,Fmembers of the Royal British Legion
OL,15,Foutside the Corby Cube on Tuesday.
OL,17,FThe flash flood, believed to have been
OL,18,Ftriggered by a glacial collapse, swept
OL,19,Fthrough a Himalayan valley on 26
OL,20,FAugust, killing more than 1,000 people.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,368,360,200,160,0,100
