OL,3,GNEWSACommunity holds vigil for
OL,4,ANepal-Tibet flood victims
OL,5,
OL,6,F"Despite being more than 4,500 miles
OL,7,Faway from home, we felt a profound duty
OL,8,Fto send our collective prayers,
OL,9,Fstrength and solidarity to the victims
OL,10,Fand front-line volunteers back home,"
OL,11,Fsaid Jivan Gurung, secretary of the
OL,12,FCorby Nepalese Community.
OL,23,APub: 02-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
